// Timeline 的分组视觉记录由 UIX 唯一拥有；Rust 内核负责数据、反向索引、本地化、测量与绘制算法。
<Visual
  name="TIMELINE_GEOMETRY_VISUAL"
  type="TimelineGeometryVisual"
  defaultWidth={400.0}
  itemHeight={60.0}
  minItemHeight={28.0}
  gutterFrameRatio={0.5}
  gutterMax={40.0}
  lineGutterRatio={0.4}
  rightPaddingFrameRatio={0.1}
  rightPaddingMax={8.0}
  dotRadius={5.0}
  dotRowRatio={0.18}
  dotGutterRatio={0.18}
/>

<Visual
  name="TIMELINE_TYPOGRAPHY_VISUAL"
  type="TimelineTypographyVisual"
  labelFont={timeline_body_font()}
  descriptionFont={timeline_small_font()}
  minScale={0.75}
  maxScale={1.0}
  descriptionGapScale={1.0}
  centerRatio={0.5}
/>

<Visual
  name="TIMELINE_STROKE_VISUAL"
  type="TimelineStrokeVisual"
  dotBorderMax={2.0}
  connectorHalfWidth={1.0}
  connectorWidth={2.0}
/>

<Visual
  name="TIMELINE_PALETTE_VISUAL"
  type="TimelinePaletteVisual"
  text={timeline_text_color()}
  textSecondary={timeline_secondary_text_color()}
  border={timeline_border_color()}
  dotBorder={timeline_dot_border_color()}
  primary={timeline_primary_color()}
/>

<Visual
  name="TIMELINE_VISUAL"
  type="TimelineVisual"
  geometry={TIMELINE_GEOMETRY_VISUAL}
  typography={TIMELINE_TYPOGRAPHY_VISUAL}
  stroke={TIMELINE_STROKE_VISUAL}
  palette={TIMELINE_PALETTE_VISUAL}
/>

<KernelView value={build_timeline_view(kernel, TIMELINE_VISUAL_REF)} />
